  "concrete_source_cause": "Pinned Actor::LoadFromNode strips Command, then Actor::AddCommand strips Message and stores message handlers in the same command map. Screen::BeginScreen plays Begin; ActorFrame propagates this direct command through screen children. Native capture consequently invokes the two foreground ActorProxy BeginMessageCommand handlers at seconds zero, despite no Begin broadcast and nil player targets. Independent startup explicitly requests BeginCommand and only checks that literal authored field, omitting both handlers and their four begin/end trace events. The remaining callback ordinal differences follow this missing prefix. The two owned sole-subscriber errors and four failed-state differences have a separate already validated fix.",
